This project is designed to rebase onto Lawnchair, a GPLv3 home app
built on Android Launcher3:

  Lawnchair  https://github.com/LawnchairLauncher/lawnchair
  License    GNU General Public License v3.0
  Launcher3  Android Open Source Project, Apache License 2.0

Lawnchair and AOSP Launcher3 source are NOT vendored in this
repository. See docs/LAWNCHAIR_REBASE.md.

Island-style work-profile isolation is implemented with public
Android DevicePolicyManager / LauncherApps / UserManager APIs.
The UX is inspired by:

  Island   https://github.com/oasisfeng/island   GPLv3
  Insular  (Island fork)                         GPLv3

No Island or Insular source code is included.

AndroidX / Jetpack / Kotlin / kotlinx.serialization are Apache 2.0.

Shizuku (https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku) is Apache License 2.0.
This tree ships an embed skeleton (`shizuku-embed/`) and a client of
the stock Shizuku app. We do not use Shizuku as the app name, do not
use moe.shizuku.privileged.api as applicationId, and do not ship
Shizuku launcher icons (Apache 2.0 §6 as stated by upstream).
See shizuku-embed/LICENSE and shizuku-embed/NOTICE.

See THIRD_PARTY.md.
